A||||7||86SE||3.4L Fuel Economy?||||5||
Z||000000||86SE||08-10-2001||01:58 PM||||What do you 3.4 guys get for gas mileage.  With my tired 2.8 auto I get about 25 MPG city/highway combined.  I heard a while ago that 3.4's in Fieros get better mileage, but just wondering how much better, if any.<P>And does anyone know where to get a performance cam for a 3.4 and how much HP/Torque does it gain?<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://fierodude.hypermart.net/mysig.jpg">   <BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>V-6 w/rod knock Yellow Fiero<BR> -- 3.4L Conversion *Back in session!* --||||reg||5
Z||000001||Alex4mula||08-10-2001||02:17 PM||||I get about the same MPG as you but I have a leaded foot. 2.8 cams will work for 3.4. You may get 10-15HP more depending on other mods.||||reg||1
Z||000002||MinnGreenGT||08-10-2001||02:42 PM||||I'm not sure exactly how closely related the 3.1 & 3.4 are, but my High-Output 3.1 gets a little less than what you're listing.  I also have a 440 4-spd OD Auto Tranny.  I get about 16-18 in town (3mi trips to & from office), about 22-25 at 75mph cruise, and about 35+ at 95mph cruise (Coming back from Dells Run this year!).<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngt.jpg">  <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
Z||000003||Cooter||08-10-2001||05:43 PM||||3.4/4.10's gets around 22 mpg.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Old Lar||08-10-2001||08:28 PM||||I'm getting a consistant 30+ with the t440 OD and cruise at 70-75.  Thats 1700-1800 rpm.||||reg||1
Z||000005||88formula||08-10-2001||10:29 PM||||19.5 mpg with 5-speed getrad. ||||reg||1
Z||000006||Black88GT||08-10-2001||10:36 PM||||If I drive conservatively, I can pull out around 25-27 mpg, mixed city and highway.  Usually though I get around 20-22.  This is a 3.4 with 5 speed and MSD.||||reg||1
Z||000007||86SE||08-11-2001||02:34 PM||||Seems like the 3.4's get about the same mileage as the 2.8's.<P>So stock Fiero 2.8 cams put in a 3.4 engine increases power?  Awesome.||||reg||14
